  "name": {
   "zh": "重新打光 · DiffusionRenderer",
   "en": "Relight · DiffusionRenderer"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "Cosmos DiffusionRenderer 的渲染模型不做显式光线传输模拟，从 G-buffer 生成照片级画面，论文把重新打光列为它的用途之一。这张卡先拆出 G-buffer，再用一张 HDRI 给整段镜头重新打光，交付 EXR 的 rgba。",
   "en": "Cosmos DiffusionRenderer's rendering model produces photorealistic images from G-buffers without explicit light transport simulation; the paper lists relighting among its uses. This card first splits out the G-buffers, then relights the whole shot with an HDRI and delivers the EXR's rgba."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-12T08:00:00",
  "deliverable": "relight",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
